{"id":"do","lemma":"до","pos":"prep","rank":62,"glosses":["before","up to, till, until","with respect to, concerning, regarding"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4a/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Подожди до завтра.","en":"Wait until tomorrow.","words":[{"g":"to wait","l":"подождать"},null,{"g":"tomorrow"}]},{"text":"Кто жил здесь до вас?","en":"Who lived here before you?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to live","l":"жить"},{"g":"here"},null,{"g":"you","l":"вы"}]},{"text":"Это может подождать до завтра?","en":"Can it wait until tomorrow?","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to wait"},null,{"g":"tomorrow"}]},{"text":"Том был там до конца?","en":"Was Tom there until the end?","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"there"},null,{"g":"end","l":"конец"}]},{"text":"Я могу остаться здесь до завтра.","en":"I can stay here until tomorrow.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to remain, to stay"},{"g":"here"},null,{"g":"tomorrow"}]}]}